            "body": "Hello!\r\n\r\nI am not sure I completely understand this. Do you mean like the following:\r\n- Inside command line type `nivim ini`.\r\n- Instead of opening Neovim with single buffer for 'ini' file, look inside current directory (maybe recursive) for files with name \"similar\" to 'ini'. Somehow suggest them to user.\r\n\r\nSomething like that?",
